            <ArticleTitle>Aortic dissection.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>372-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The presentation of aortic dissection in the emergency department may be more subtle than the classic description of a shocked patient with &quot;ripping&quot; chest pain. The epidemiology, variation in presentation, investigation, and management of aortic dissection are reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
